"Watt Traders offer a rotating selection of balls and TRs plus Wishing Pieces, and provide bike upgrades and Rotom Rally. Ingredient sellers stand in Rolling Fields and near the Hammerlocke entrance; their daily stock differs. The handbook lists complete offering pools, not current rotations. The skill-focused Digging Duo brother finds rarer objects but generally digs fewer times; the stamina-focused brother can continue longer. Each attempt costs 500 W. Fishers and Hikers exchange Watts for random rewards; Hiker pools change with story progress. Search the separate pool categories for relative rarity.\",\"citation\":\"Official Sword/Shield guide, pp. 275–279\"}]";
